# LED Shooter Project - ESP-IDF

This is an ESP-IDF v5.5 project for controlling WS2812 LED strips on ESP32.

## Project Structure

- `components/led_strip/` - Reusable LED strip component
  - `led_strip.h` - Public API header
  - `led_strip.c` - Implementation with RMT driver
  - Supports WS2812 LED strips via RMT peripheral
  - Includes rainbow chase animation as a FreeRTOS task

- `main/` - Main application code
  - `main.c` - Application entry point

## Key Features

- LED strip control with brightness support
- Rainbow chase animation running as FreeRTOS task
- RMT-based WS2812 protocol implementation
- Component-based architecture for reusability

## Coding Standards

- Use ESP-IDF error handling (ESP_ERROR_CHECK)
- Follow ESP-IDF naming conventions
- Use FreeRTOS tasks for background operations
- Include proper error checking and logging
- Use ESP_LOGI/ESP_LOGE for logging

## Build System

- ESP-IDF v5.5
- CMake build system
- Target: ESP32

## Dependencies

- `esp_driver_rmt` - RMT driver for LED control
- FreeRTOS - For task management

